  "issue": {
    "body": "I'd like for us to document how to use `httpx.AsyncClient` as test client on the [testclient](https://www.starlette.io/testclient/) page, or at least add a note about it with a reference to [`httpx` section \"Calling into Python Web Apps\"](https://www.python-httpx.org/async/#calling-into-python-web-apps).\r\n\r\nThe idea here is just to present the possibility to use the \"async test setup\".\r\n\r\nNote: this issue is not in conflict with any other discussion about removing the `TestClient` from Starlette or replacing `requests` by `httpx` internally.",
    "closed_at": "2022-07-06T16:43:04Z",
